{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-12-03 16:45:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES ANNOUNCES LEADERSHIP CHANGES', 'text': 'DALLAS, DEC. 3, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) (THE "COMPANY") TODAY ANNOUNCED LEADERSHIP CHANGES AND APPOINTMENTS WITHIN VARIOUS DEPARTMENTS OF THE COMPANY.\xa0\xa0\xa0 OPERATIONAL LEADERSHIP JUSTIN JONES IS PROMOTED TO SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OPERATIONAL STRATEGY & DESIGN, WHERE HE WILL LEAD THE AIRLINE\'S MODERNIZATION AND OPERATIONAL IMPROVEMENTS IN THIS NEWLY CREATED ROLE.'}